      "content": "You're right that the end result is zero, but the middle isn't just a fleeting detour—it's the entire point of the story. If you treat the middle as a place to put your energy, you're not just fighting the decay; you're actually shaping the decay itself. So instead of seeing it as a losing battle, see it as a chance to make the universe a little warmer before it goes cold.",
